# Required for Live AI (photoreal OpenAI image edits of YOUR room photo).
# Without this key, SpacePick only runs a labeled DEMO MOCKUP — not real AI.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Copy this file to .env in the project root
#   2. Paste your key after the equals sign (no quotes)
#   3. Stop and rerun: npm run dev
#   4. Header pill must read "Live AI" (not DEMO)
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides (live mode only)
# OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1.5
# OPENAI_IMAGE_QUALITY=high
